        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa ghwajoar Yabini ea lugoadaanyi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea ghwayiiy Yabini was sugoocheanda mujiineeda Hasori ng'asheesu, goojeaksa Yobabu, was sugoocheanda mujiineeda Madoni, ea sugoocheanda Shimroni, ea sugoocheanda mujiineeda Akshafu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea sugoocheanda mida wiilooda ng'eanyiida ghayeawa bea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, ea gea mida Araba bea wiilooda ng'eanyiida biyeara bea Gineroti, ea gea mida moohajeega, ea gea mida heayeeniga neekeewa Dori bea meatkweeda biyeara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea ghoah fuga Ganaani mida heeda ghayeawa ea heeda biyeara, ea fuga Amori, ea Hiti, ea Berisi, ea Yebusi ea gea mida ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, ea Hifi mida hing'eadayda Hermoni bea ng'eanyiida Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwardu jarooda sea dabita nyaawa sean, ea lugooda haw, mooneeda nyaawa gawuurji iseaskweanda ghuuta basooda, ea faraasajeega saang'a ea mutukwajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaroonyi sugoodisu seaniin sea lugweega nyaawa ak geapka ak geewus nea geabwat geat aba ghuuta beega Meromu, eeng'uchi sea fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Yoshuwa, “Adibeali aba saawa, aba gideaba numuji damanda uurji nih gaydanung' eabwar sean aba madeeda fuga Israeli ak gaylajaada mayiishka faraasajeega nyaawa, nea gighwardi mutukwajeega nyaawa aba beasta.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwashuubean Yoshuwa nea goodeayi fugaaschi sean bea ng'ucheeda ak gang'uchi aba ghuuta beega Meromu ak gang'eesa fugiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwayiin NG'UTAMIIDA saawa geatinga fuga Israeli, ak geabwar, ak geahoan ea ghwahita Sidoneeda haw ea Misrefot-maimu, ea ghwahita moangoachiyda Mispa mida meatkweeda ghayeawa, ak geabwar ea ea mudeapuut eara siyagi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwasima Yoshuwa saawa giduurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA niny; ak ghwalajaada mayiishka faraasajeega nyaawa nea ghaghwarda mutukwajeega nyaawa aba beasta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gabiigu Yoshuwa aba damandida, ak ghoang'waay Hasori ak ghabwar sugoocheandaanyi aba ng'uta; aba gideaba ng'eanyiida Hasori ghayi aba mwadi goombal sugoodisu seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabwar sean aba ng'uta gea mida jeeda Hasori, ak geenung' goosha sean nea meapuuda eara siyagi aba gea gisa jeameeda, ng'ata ghaghwarda Hasori aba beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea mujiinajeega sean bea sugoodiga, ea sugoodiga nyaawa, ghoang'waay Yoshuwa ak ghabwar aba ng'uta, ea ghwanung' goosha sean, gawuurji gidaghayi rukuteayda Musa, was siida gadiyeeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mujiinajeega mida uhuuda giijeega ea miighaghwarda fuga Israeli, geaghus Hasori; was dea ghwarda Yoshuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak haleanjeeda sean mida jeedeaba mujiineani, ea dugwa, gageanda fuga Israeli ghoah geanyaawa; sighus gilinyoo ea siida gil, geabwar aba ng'uta, ea eenung' goosha ak ea manda dea abiida aba gilinyoo gaksa jeameeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa was siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda, hean gwarukusa Musa Yoshuwa, hean gwasinda Yoshuwa gidida; ea manda ng'asheega ninung'waada sean aba gea rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ng'eanyiida ang'waay Yoshuwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waay Yoshuwa ng'eanyiisean, ng'eanyiida heayeeniga ea Negebooda sean ea ng'eanyiisean bea Gosheni ea ng'eanyiida moohajeega ea Araba ea ng'eanyiida heayeeniga bea Israeli ea moohajeagaaschi ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghang'eada Giijeega Halaki, gal meatkweeda Seyiri, ea ghwahita Baal-gadi mida jeeda moangoachiyda Lebanoni mida hing'eadayda Giijeeda Hermoni. Ak ghoang'waay eara sugoodiga nyaawa, ak ghabwar gameewa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gang'uchi Yoshuwa gidageaw sea sugoodisu seaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea manda mujiineeda nisin hoyyoo sea fuga Israeli, geaghus fugiga bea Hafiti abiita Gibeoniin; geang'waay sean aba ng'ucheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ghoahang'waay NG'UTAMIIDA gurooruunatka nyaawa ak ghapka gang'uchi sea fuga Israeli, nea gabaysiina gideaba ghwanung' goosha, ak ea meabwayda geenung' goosha, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA Musa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gawa Yoshuwa aba damandida, ak ghabwar fuga Anakimu mida ng'eanyiida heayeeniga, ea gea mida Hebroni, ea Debiri, ea Anabu, ea gea mida ng'eanyiisean bea heayeeniga Yuda, ea gea mida heayeeniga sean bea ng'eanyiida Israeli; ak gahuuyda Yoshuwa saawa ea mujiinajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea manda fuga Anakimu abit aba ng'eanyiida Israeli; geaghus suh ng'ay abit aba ng'eanyiida Gaasa, ea jeeda Gati, ea Ashdodi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoang'waay Yoshuwa ng'eanyiisean, gawuurji gidarukusiinda NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheega sean Musa; ak ghoadaw Yoshuwa fuga Israeli gwahearan, nea gwaheeli gaba nih bea eemeadaanyi. Ak gwayi saw ng'eanyiida ak ea mudugwanda ng'ucheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
